{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.poster.avif?t=1772241238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.webm?t=1772241238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.mp4?t=1772241238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Faces is a psychological horror about hallucinations and facing your past taking you through a journey\u00a0inside the collapsing mind of Jack Hallow. His rotting apartment is your hub, a place infected by dark tendrils that seal mirrors and twists reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mirror pulls you into a memory chapter, a nightmare shaped by a person from Jack\u2019s past. Between chapters, the dark realm engulfs you, a mind palace ocean where Jack\u2019s guilt forms floating memory spheres. Destroying a sphere shatters part of the corruption, reshaping the apartment and revealing the next memory and location he must confront,\u00a0such as his childhood home and the hospital where his father Arthur passed away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece by piece, the truth behind Jack\u2019s family and what he did is revealed. In Dead Faces, remembering is either the key to redemption, or the final step towards madness. Unravel Jack's disturbing mind, the faces from his past and the truth behind his actions. You must remember their faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.poster.avif?t=1772241238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.webm?t=1772241238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/9701be99a59ebdb5486cf3e4421d939e.mp4?t=1772241238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Selectable Chapters:</strong> Access each chapter through mirrors in Jack\u2019s decaying apartment, each focused on a person from his past and a different location tied to his memories. Uncover the truth behind his fractured mind in a 4\u20135 hour journey through psychological madness and hallucinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Dynamic Hallucination System:</strong> Experience unpredictable scares as objects morph, spaces distort, and reality bends differently with every playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Realism:</strong> Explore realistic atmospheric nightmarish locations from Jack's memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Apartment Hub:</strong>\u00a0Revisit Jack's everchanging apartment after each chapter as it further decays and twists reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Audio Pooling System:</strong>\u00a0The game never sounds the same and chooses from a large pool of audio randomly to keep the player paranoid throughout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Storytelling:</strong> A story-rich psychological descent with multiple endings told through visual storytelling, dynamic events, and surreal progression instead of traditional objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themes:</strong> Themes of Depression, Hallucinations, Suicide, Isolation and a moody nightmarish atmosphere throughout the entire game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.poster.avif?t=1772241238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.webm?t=1772241238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/445a1492d8e80c44afdbe740571c7d2d.mp4?t=1772241238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2822770?t=1772241238","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2822770?t=1772241238","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/7b1bf7552704a758af31cddb243617f59f850ff6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772241238","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/7b1bf7552704a758af31cddb243617f59f850ff6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772241238","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Graphic gore, violence."},"demos":[{"appid":2834420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2822770/extras/4cbadce0bcca3d5f24028d7a448ce1ab.poster.avif?t